    "payload": {
      "repository_id": 825081672,
      "push_id": 21933359168,
      "size": 5,
      "distinct_size": 0,
      "ref": "refs/heads/lineage-21",
      "head": "0e3ef2fd3fa6cac2b104484578c9bf9379d95c77",
      "before": "fa69080632f21878b892597b9234072d88db4daf",
      "commits": [
        {
          "sha": "ee8da1960b19749ac0f05525da15c90a7ab3f8c8",
          "author": {
            "email": "vinmenon@codeaurora.org",
            "name": "Vinayak Menon"
          },
          "message": "ARM64: dts: msm: disable memcg kernel and socket accounting on sdm845\n\nDisable memcg kernel and socket accounting on sdm845 since\nmemory cgroups is used in this target as a means of user space\ntask grouping based on oom_score_adj, and controlling the userspace\nmemory consumed by tasks. Kernel and socket memory accounting is\nnot considered. Since memcg is created per process on this target\nenabling kernel accounting results in the creation of numerous\nkmem caches resulting in significant overhead.\n\nChange-Id: I2caad9ce6cca5846b6183a0f0753977db54a660d\nSigned-off-by: Vinayak Menon <vinmenon@codeaurora.org>",
          "distinct": false,
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/lge-sdm845/android_kernel_lge_sdm845/commits/ee8da1960b19749ac0f05525da15c90a7ab3f8c8"
        },
        {
          "sha": "c671d976209c319fb58cbdb6d3ef81dbf0d70471",
          "author": {
            "email": "stanley.hsu@cypress.com",
            "name": "Chung-Hsien Hsu"
          },
          "message": "nl80211: add WPA3 definition for SAE authentication\n\nAdd definition of WPA version 3 for SAE authentication.\n\nChange-Id: I19ca34b8965168f011cc1352eba420f2d54b0258\nSigned-off-by: Chung-Hsien Hsu <stanley.hsu@cypress.com>\nSigned-off-by: Chi-Hsien Lin <chi-hsien.lin@cypress.com>\nSigned-off-by: Johannes Berg <johannes.berg@intel.com>",
          "distinct": false,
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/lge-sdm845/android_kernel_lge_sdm845/commits/c671d976209c319fb58cbdb6d3ef81dbf0d70471"
        },
        {
          "sha": "549639f220b9bfad37b3dc8502cb28dd21c9ce39",
          "author": {
            "email": "priv.luk@gmail.com",
            "name": "LuK1337"
          },
          "message": "ARM64: vdso32: Hardcode toolchain target\n\nFixes the following error when building with clang r530567:\nerror: version 'kernel' in target triple 'arm-unknown-linux-androidkernel' is invalid\n\nChange-Id: I5a2d27bf0e8a22b2fe752c64efc0cc91c790b5f0",
          "distinct": false,
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/lge-sdm845/android_kernel_lge_sdm845/commits/549639f220b9bfad37b3dc8502cb28dd21c9ce39"
        },
        {
          "sha": "8dfe28be640ace963c0bd8c3ca9c73d320ed34af",
          "author": {
            "email": "chrmhoffmann@gmail.com",
            "name": "Christian Hoffmann"
          },
          "message": "arch: arm64: vdso32: Drop -no-integrated-as\n\nChange-Id: Id4b4b2a55bf4e8205bab3ea4f2fce338a2aa74e9",
          "distinct": false,
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/lge-sdm845/android_kernel_lge_sdm845/commits/8dfe28be640ace963c0bd8c3ca9c73d320ed34af"
        },
        {
          "sha": "0e3ef2fd3fa6cac2b104484578c9bf9379d95c77",
          "author": {
            "email": "hansol@hansol.ca",
            "name": "Han Sol Jin"
          },
          "message": "Merge branch 'lineage-20' of https://github.com/LineageOS/android_kernel_qcom_sdm845 into lineage-21\n\n* 'lineage-20' of https://github.com/LineageOS/android_kernel_qcom_sdm845:\n  arch: arm64: vdso32: Drop -no-integrated-as\n  ARM64: vdso32: Hardcode toolchain target\n  nl80211: add WPA3 definition for SAE authentication\n  ARM64: dts: msm: disable memcg kernel and socket accounting on sdm845\n  dsp: q6voice: Switch to __builtin_add_overflow\n  Revert \"soc: qcom: smem: Add boundary checks for partitions\"\n  adsprpc: Handle UAF scenario in put_args\n  msm: adsprpc: Handle UAF in fastrpc internal munmap\n  msm: adsprpc: Clean DMA handles maps in case of  error\n  kconfig/lxdialog: Make main() return 0\n  qcacld-3.0: Remove use-after-free of frame in tx mgmt send\n  BACKPORT: PM / core: Add support to skip power management in device/driver model\n  securemsm-kernel: Fixed multiple listener registration on same fd\n  msm: kgsl: Fix error handling during drawctxt switch\n  dsp: q6voice: Adds checks for an integer overflow\n  qcacmn: Fix out of bound read issue in ESP ie parse\n  msm: kgsl: Update the protect register list\n  msm: kgsl: Do not release dma and anon buffers if unmap fails\n  soc: qcom: smem: Add boundary checks for partitions\n  msm: kgsl: Do not free sharedmem if it cannot be unmapped\n  dsp: q6lsm: Address use after free for mmap handle\n  ASoC: msm-pcm-host-voice: Check validity of session idx\n  ASoC: msm-pcm-voip: Avoid interger underflow\n  ASoC: msm-pcm-voip: Avoid interger underflow\n  ASoC: msm-pcm-host-voice: Address buffer overflow in hpcm capture copy\n  dsp: add change to enable preemption at cal_utils_dealloc_cal.\n  dsp: add change to handle use-after-free in cal_utils_is_cal_stale\n\nChange-Id: I1f2691cd7a7ba6c3b36f494aa5f3dc4e72f273c4\nSigned-off-by: Han Sol Jin <hansol@hansol.ca>",
          "distinct": false,
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/lge-sdm845/android_kernel_lge_sdm845/commits/0e3ef2fd3fa6cac2b104484578c9bf9379d95c77"
        }
      ]
    },
