          "patch_url": "https://github.com/agda/agda-stdlib/pull/2536.patch",
          "merged_at": null
        },
        "body": "This tackles the second part of #2274 as a followup to #2491 by replacing the in-place definition of negated equality in `Algebra.Bundles.Raw.*` with a delegation to its definition in the underlying `RawSetoid` bundle via an additional `rawSetoid` manifest field.\r\n\r\nOutstanding issues:\r\n* should the new field itself be publicly exported throughout, rather than simply the negated equality, as previously?\r\n* does this addition give rise to similar problems as those recently fixed by #2499 ?\r\n",
        "reactions": {
